# Checklist 43 (the emulator half): track whatever is in the frame from
# the image alone. Needs tonight's guide calibration, which locking on a
# target provides; then it is followed with no prediction. Kochab
# (dec +74), because at this site it is in the tracking band at any hour
# -- the emulated mount points where a target really is, and a planet
# below the horizon is rightly refused. Phase 127 found the emulator's
# guide pulses moved RA and Dec while the real fork's move azimuth and
# altitude, which threw this star out of the frame; fixed in the emulator.
name    Motion: track what is in the frame
timeout 300

profile star.ini focuser position=168000

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Motion
wait   3
goto   Kochab
expect 120 SEARCHING
wait   3
press  PLANET LOCK
expect 90  Acquisition: Locked
wait   3
press  GOTO:PASSES
press  GOTO:TRACK WHAT IS IN FRAME
expect 10  Moving target: following what is in the frame.
absent 5   nothing bright enough in the frame
absent 1   Not following
wait   10
shot   following
press  GOTO:TRACK WHAT IS IN FRAME
expect 20  Worst error on target
